<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1899317143"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1597879226"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Euphoria (feat. Tsugumi Nagahara)"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="PIKASONIC / Tsugumi Nagahara / Tatsunoshin"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Euphoria (feat. Tsugumi Nagahara)"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="03:28.456"><div begin="00:02.584" end="03:28.456"><p begin="00:02.584" end="00:05.050" itunes:key="L1">ずっと<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">早已</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">zu っto</span></p><p begin="00:05.051" end="00:07.486" itunes:key="L2">消えていったこの感情<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">消失不见的这份感情</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki e te yi っta ko no kan jiyo</span></p><p begin="00:07.487" end="00:10.432" itunes:key="L3">きっと もっと<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一定是源于</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki っto mo っto</span></p><p begin="00:10.433" end="00:13.959" itunes:key="L4">記憶の海を辿って<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在记忆之海中摸索前行时</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki oku no umi wo tado っte</span></p><p begin="00:13.960" end="00:18.431" itunes:key="L5">あなたの微笑みを閉じ込めて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">封存了你的笑容</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a na ta no bi wala mi wo xi ji ko me te</span></p><p begin="00:18.432" end="00:21.504" itunes:key="L6">きっと もっと<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一定是为了更好地</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki っto mo っto</span></p><p begin="00:21.505" end="00:24.743" itunes:key="L7">孤独のこの世界で<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在这个孤独的世界里</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko doku no ko no yo kai de</span></p><p begin="00:24.744" end="00:27.536" itunes:key="L8">迷い 出会い<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">迷惘，并相遇</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mayo yi de kai yi</span></p><p begin="00:27.537" end="00:30.271" itunes:key="L9">日暮れの空へ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">向着夕阳西下的天空</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">hi ku le no sola he</span></p><p begin="00:30.272" end="00:33.123" itunes:key="L10">僕と 君と<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你与我在一起</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">boku to kimi to</span></p><p begin="00:33.124" end="00:35.806" itunes:key="L11">手を繋いていこう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">携手并肩同行</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">te wo cuna yi te yi ko wu</span></p><p begin="00:35.807" end="00:38.655" itunes:key="L12">怒り 痛み<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无论愤怒还是痛苦</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">oko li yita mi</span></p><p begin="00:38.656" end="00:41.486" itunes:key="L13">全部忘れて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">把它们尽数忘记</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">sube bu wasu le te</span></p><p begin="00:41.487" end="00:44.870" itunes:key="L14">僕と 君と<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我和你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">boku to kimi to</span></p><p begin="00:44.871" end="00:46.754" itunes:key="L15">輝いていこう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">闪耀前行</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki yi te yi ko wu</span></p><p begin="01:19.530" end="01:21.798" itunes:key="L16">ずっと<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你一直</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">zu っto</span></p><p begin="01:21.799" end="01:24.346" itunes:key="L17">君が抱えてるもの<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">紧抱不放的事物</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">kimi ga da e te lu mo no</span></p><p begin="01:24.347" end="01:27.377" itunes:key="L18">きっと もっと<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">对我而言</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki っto mo っto</span></p><p begin="01:27.378" end="01:30.746" itunes:key="L19">僕の大切なもの<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">也一定是无上的宝物</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">boku no oo secu na mo no</span></p><p begin="01:30.747" end="01:35.378" itunes:key="L20">あなたが忘れていたとしても<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即使你已然忘却</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a na ta ga wasu le te yi ta to xi te mo</span></p><p begin="01:35.379" end="01:38.406" itunes:key="L21">きっと もっと<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们也一定会</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki っto mo っto</span></p><p begin="01:38.407" end="01:40.740" itunes:key="L22">孤独のこの世界で<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在这个孤独的世界里</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko doku no ko no yo kai de</span></p><p begin="01:41.825" end="01:44.325" itunes:key="L23">迷い 出会い<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">迷惘，并相遇</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mayo yi de kai yi</span></p><p begin="01:44.326" end="01:47.144" itunes:key="L24">日暮れの空へ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">向着夕阳西下的天空</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">hi ku le no sola he</span></p><p begin="01:47.145" end="01:49.846" itunes:key="L25">僕と 君と<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你与我在一起</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">boku to kimi to</span></p><p begin="01:49.847" end="01:52.624" itunes:key="L26">手を繋いていこう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">携手并肩同行</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">te wo cuna yi te yi ko wu</span></p><p begin="01:52.625" end="01:55.342" itunes:key="L27">怒り 痛み<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无论愤怒还是痛苦</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">oko li yita mi</span></p><p begin="01:55.343" end="01:58.048" itunes:key="L28">全部忘れて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">把它们尽数忘记</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">sube bu wasu le te</span></p><p begin="01:58.049" end="02:01.472" itunes:key="L29">僕と 君と<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我和你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">boku to kimi to</span></p><p begin="02:01.473" end="02:03.426" itunes:key="L30">輝いていこう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">闪耀前行</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki yi te yi ko wu</span></p><p begin="02:25.670" end="02:28.343" itunes:key="L31">怒り 痛み<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无论愤怒还是痛苦</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">oko li yita mi</span></p><p begin="02:28.344" end="02:31.157" itunes:key="L32">全部忘れて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">把它们尽数忘记</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">sube bu wasu le te</span></p><p begin="02:31.158" end="02:34.614" itunes:key="L33">僕と 君と<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我和你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">boku to kimi to</span></p><p begin="02:34.615" end="03:28.456" itunes:key="L34">輝いていこう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">闪耀前行</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki yi te yi ko wu</span></p></div></body></tt>